OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman set to speak as
OL,4,Acalls grow for AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia chief executive Jensen Huang
OL,7,Fsays there's no need for new laws on AI
OL,8,F- instead AI companies should "simply
OL,9,Fnot release anything that they are not
OL,10,Fconfident will be safe"
OL,12,FHe's one of several AI bosses speaking
OL,13,Fat a conference in California.
OL,14,FAnthropic's boss says it is tempting to
OL,15,F"attack" competitors but it is more
OL,16,Fresponsible to try and establish
OL,17,Findustry-wide standards
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
