OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman set to speak as
OL,4,Acalls grow for AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Senator Bernie Sanders calls
OL,7,Fon the US to work with China on AI
OL,8,Fregulation, saying a treaty should be
OL,9,Festablished to pause development on "AI
OL,10,Fsuperintelligence"
OL,12,FHis remarks were made at a summit in
OL,13,FWashington, where Steve Bannon, a
OL,14,Fformer Trump adviser, called AI the
OL,15,F"defining issue of our time" - their
OL,16,Fjoint appearance is a rare show of
OL,17,Fbipartisanship, writes our Washington
OL,18,Fcorrespondent
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
