OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman set to speak as
OL,4,Acalls grow for AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after an Anthropic executive
OL,7,Ftold the BBC that AI is getting more
OL,8,Fpowerful "by the day" and a kill switch
OL,9,Fshould be mandatory
OL,11,FEarlier this week, Donald Trump
OL,12,Fdownplayed AI concerns, saying claims
OL,13,Fthat it will take over the world are a
OL,14,F"hoax"
